          "Feelings of worthlessness and excessive self-blame ('everything is my fault')"
        ],
        "count": 3
      },
      {
        "group": "associated_vegetative_symptoms",
        "confirmed_symptoms": [
          "Difficulty falling asleep and early morning awakening (3-4am) most nights",
