          "Reduced energy/coffee dependence, though patient uncertain if this is true fatigue"
        ],
        "count": 3
      },
      {
        "group": "cognitive_symptoms",
        "confirmed_symptoms": [
          "Reports feeling 'fuzzy' at times but denies clear-cut concentration or decision-making impairment"
        ],
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "group": "functional_impairment_indicators",
        "confirmed_symptoms": [
          "Performance issues at work prompting supervisor intervention",
          "Increased mistakes and reduced productivity",
          "Household disorganization and social withdrawal (missed plans, unkempt living space)"
        ],
        "count": 3
      },
      {
        "group": "suicidality_screen",
        "confirmed_symptoms": [
          "Denies active suicidal ideation or self-harm intent",
          "No plan or intent reported despite some passive zoning-out episodes while driving"
        ],
        "count": 2
      }
    ],
    "duration_verified": "Symptoms of depressed mood and associated features have been present nearly continuously for approximately 2 years and 1 month, with only brief, non-sustained periods of symptom relief, satisfying the 2-year minimum duration criterion for persistent depressive disorder.",
